-- DC cloak appearance wiring, generated 2026-08-25.
-- Downported Back-slot displays shipped icon-only: no ModelTexture_1 and no GeosetGroup_1,
-- so the client had nothing to draw (a cloak is a character GEOSET, not a model).
-- Values come from retail ItemDisplayInfo.ModelMaterialResourcesID_0 -> TextureFileData,
-- and retail GeosetGroup_0 CLAMPED to 5 (3.3.5 cape geosets only go to 5; 371 rows clamped).
-- itemdisplayinfo_dbc OVERRIDES the binary DBC at startup, so this must be applied or the
-- rebuilt ItemDisplayInfo.dbc is undone for any display that already has a row here.
-- Guarded with ModelTexture_1 = '' so it is idempotent and cannot clobber a deliberate value.

